```

```
2026 Oct 27 20:20:19 user.notice awplus 802.1X[1094]: port1.0.48: Supplicant cktls unauthorized, Mac 000d.b955.770f
2026 Oct 27 20:20:27 user.notice awplus 802.1X[1094]: 802.1X Authentication failed (retry=0) for cktls@000d.b955.770f on port1.0.48
```

**The pair is what carries the verdict:** the same supplicant, same identity, same port, same
TLS settings, 90 seconds apart — Authorized with a certificate this DUT's CA issued, Held and
Unauthorized with one it did not. The DUT is not admitting everybody.

